<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA JSE'S DURR TO JOIN SBC WARBURG.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA JSE'S DURR TO JOIN SBC WARBURG.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) said on Tuesday that its listings director, Mark Durr, will be leaving the bourse to join brokerage SBC Warburg from October 1.</p>
<p>It said that John Burke, currently JSE corporate finance manager, will take over from Durr.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
